window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It seemed like a good idea at the time. A two-week Hawaiian vacation with a beautiful woman. What could go wrong? </p> <p>Well, when that woman is my best friend’s little sister, the answer is - everything.</p> <p>Mackenzie Langston has been in my life since we were kids, and until now, I didn’t see past her family and our friendship. So when she tells me she’s sworn off men for the next year after a bad breakup, I jump at the chance to have some company on the vacation I’d booked for me and my cheating ex. But Mack’s all grown up, and we’re both on the rebound.</p> <p>In a romantic suite with just one bed, the weather isn’t the only thing that gets hot. </p> <p>Turns out, what I thought was a good idea might end up one big mistake. Especially when my heart’s on the line. </p>"; 
